# Project Detail Page & Form Enhancements

## Overview
This update addresses the "Whitescreen" crash on the Project Detail Page and enhances the Project and Task creation forms to support comprehensive data entry (Dates, Status).

## Changes

### 1. Fix Blank Screen (Project Detail Page)
- **Root Cause**: The application was crashing due to `RangeError: Invalid time value` when attempting to format `null` or invalid date strings using `date-fns` in the Project Stats grid.
- **Fix**: Implemented a [safeFormat](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/pages/projectDetailPage.tsx#35-40) helper function in `ProjectDetailPage.tsx`.
- **Logic**:
  ```typescript
  const safeFormat = (dateStr: string | undefined, fmt: string) => {
    if (!dateStr) return 'Not set';
    const d = new Date(dateStr);
    return isValid(d) ? format(d, fmt) : 'Invalid Date';
  };
  ```
- **Result**: Page now renders robustly even with missing data.

### 2. Enhanced Creation & Editing Forms
- **Goal**: Allow users to input and modify Start Date, End Date, and Status.
- **Components Updated/Created**:
  - [CreateProjectModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/projects/CreateProjectModal.tsx) / [EditProjectModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/projects/EditProjectModal.tsx)
  - [CreateTaskModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/tasks/CreateTaskModal.tsx) / [EditTaskModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/tasks/EditTaskModal.tsx)
- **Features**:
  - Added native Date Pickers (styled with MUI).
  - Added Status Dropdown (Not Started, In Progress, Completed, On Hold).
  - Wired "Edit" buttons in Project Header and Task List to open pre-filled modals.

### 3. Subtask Management & Date Sync
- **Goal**: Allow adding/modifying subtasks and syncing parent task dates.
- **Components Updated**:
  - [EditTaskModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/tasks/EditTaskModal.tsx)
  - [services/subtasks.ts](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/services/subtasks.ts)
- **Features**:
  - **Subtask List**: View, Add, and Delete subtasks within the "Edit Task" modal.
  - **Smart Date Logic**: Suggestions for parent task Start/End dates are calculated based on the min/max of subtasks.
  - **Sync Button**: Users can one-click apply the suggested date range or manually override.

